{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"initialEntities"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":"])"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Does "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" record changes — the data is already persisted."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Important","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"first-load"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" hydration only. Do not use this initializer","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to “refresh from disk” mid-session by assigning into a live "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntityStore"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(e.g. "},{"code":"state.items = EntityStore(fetched)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" from a CloudKit re-hydrate action)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In-memory state may hold unflushed writes or live UI bindings; wholesale"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"replacement silently drops them and surfaces as lost keystrokes. Use","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/merge(from:shouldReplace:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" for that path — it records no changes and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lets you decide per-ID which side wins. Under ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSPersistentCloudKitContainer","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the gotcha is especially sharp: ","type":"text"},{"code":".NSPersistentStoreRemoteChange","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" fires for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"local saves too, so a naïve “refresh on remote change” observer feeds the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"app its own writes."}]}],"style":"important"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Entities sharing an ID are collapsed to the first occurrence. A store","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"cannot represent duplicates — ","type":"text"},{"code":"positions","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" holds one index per ID — and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"admitting them corrupts the index: the map would keep only the last"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index while the array kept every copy, so "},{"code":"count","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" over-reports and a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"later delete orphans the earlier copy with no "},{"code":"positions","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" entry at all,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"leaving a row that is visible in "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/values","isActive":true},{"text":" but invisible to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/contains(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and the subscript. Persisted rows can legitimately","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"share an ID (CloudKit forbids unique constraints), so this initializer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"has to be total rather than trusting its input.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore"]]},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreVyACyxGSayxGcfc","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"(["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":"])"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"init","roleHeading":"Initializer","title":"init(_:)","modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/init(_:)"},"abstract":[{"text":"Creates a store pre-populated from an array (e.g. first-load hydration at app launch).","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/init(_:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux":{"url":"\/documentation\/swidux","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Redux-style state management for SwiftUI, with macros for observability and ready-made plugins for persistence, undo, paywalls, version killswitches, and parental gates."}],"title":"Swidux","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","type":"topic"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/contains(_:)":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Whether an entity with this ID exists.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/contains(_:)","kind":"symbol","title":"contains(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"contains","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","text":"UUID","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/contains(_:)","type":"topic"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An ordered, keyed collection of identifiable entities that silently records"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every mutation for downstream persistence."}],"title":"EntityStore","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntityStore","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EntityStore","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore","type":"topic"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/init(_:)":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/init(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"([","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"])","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/init(_:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a store pre-populated from an array (e.g. first-load hydration at app launch)."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"init(_:)"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/merge(from:shouldReplace:)":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/merge(from:shouldreplace:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Merges entities from another store. Entities only present in "},{"code":"other","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are always added; for IDs present in both, "},{"code":"shouldReplace","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" decides"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whether the incoming value overwrites the one already in "},{"code":"self","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"title":"merge(from:shouldReplace:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"merge","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"from","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV","text":"EntityStore","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"shouldReplace","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/merge(from:shouldReplace:)","type":"topic"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/values":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"All entities in insertion order."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/values","kind":"symbol","title":"values","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"values","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/values","type":"topic"}}}